    "ما",
    "not",
    "jussive"
   ],
   "rule": null,
   "text": "Each time has its own \"not\". The past is negated with **لم + the present form**, not with the past form; the future with **لن**. **ليس** conjugates like a past verb: لستُ، لستَ، ليست، لسنا.",
