   "points": [
    "Right to left, short vowels usually unwritten; words come from three-letter roots.",
    "ال = the; adjectives follow the noun and agree in gender, number and definiteness.",
    "No 'is' in the present (أنا طالب); كان for the past.",
    "Past = endings (كتبتُ); present = prefixes (أكتب); future = سـ / سوف.",
    "Negation by time: لا (now), لم (past), لن (future), ليس (no verb).",
    "Two nouns side by side = 'X of Y' (idafa); possessives are endings (بيتي)."
